'''A Cultured Festival''' (文化祭グルメ戦争, ''Bunkamatsuri Gurume Sensō'', '''Culture Festival Gourmet War''') is a celebration event that appears during November. It was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

==Event Information==
Time to live it up and join in on the Battle Cats' Culture Festival!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from November 16th (11:00am) until November 30th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Culture Festival Stages!'''}}<br>
Fightin' Food Carts! A well-meant festival has descended into chaos as the rival chefs fling their tasty treats at each other!<br>
Go to Event Stages/Stories of Legend to take on the Culture Festival stages.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●New Limited Map: A CULTURED FESTIVAL'''}}<br>
Clear stages to earn limited unit {{Color|#980000|'''Food Stall Cat'''}} and {{Color|#9900FF|'''Lucky Ticket'''}} rewards!<br>
These rewards are more likely to drop from later stages!

Rewards: {{Color|#0000FF|'''Food Stall Cat (Rare), Lucky Ticket'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> This character cannot be unlocked again if earned from a previous event.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance of unlocking this character.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Activate your new unit in the Upgrade menu after receiving it.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Limited Map: Food Stall Cat Awakes!'''}}<br>
Clear this stage to unlock the {{Color|#38761D|'''True Form of Food Stall Cat'''}}! Take on the incredibly tough stage and unlock its true power!

Rewards: {{Color|#0000FF|'''Food Stall Cat's True Form can be unlocked'''}}<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#0000FF|'''XP'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> You must clear Cats of the Cosmos Ch. 2 for this stage to appear. You must clear A New Legend map to play this stage.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Units must be at Level 20 before they can evolve into their True Form.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> True Form evolution stage rewards can be claimed without obtaining the unit. Once the unit is obtained, it's True Form can be unlocked.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited-time Special Mission!'''}}<br>
Special Missions for the limited stage A Cultured Festival are available!<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''A Cultured Festival Special Mission'''}}<br>
Rewards: {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cat Ticket'''}}<br>
<nowiki> </nowiki>You must claim rewards from cleared Special missions before the event ends. Even if mission objectives have been met, rewards cannot be claimed after the mission disappears.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collect Lucky Tickets to use in the Lucky Capsules!'''}}<br>
Select the Cat Capsules in the Cat Base and select the {{Color|#9900FF|'''Lucky Capsules'''}} to access them! Use {{Color|#9900FF|'''Lucky Tickets'''}} to get rewards including limited Special {{Color|#FF0000|'''Li'l Cat'''}} units!

During this event, using the Rare Capsules will reward one {{Color|#9900FF|'''Lucky Ticket'''}}, so grab them while you can!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> The Lucky Capsules option will appear after you own at least one Lucky Ticket.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Lucky Tickets owned will be held over for the next event even after the current Lucky Capsules event ends.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Li'l Cat Festival on now!'''}}<br>
Awakening Stages featuring Li'l units are all available for a limited time!<br>
Clear any stage to {{Color|#34A853|'''unlock the ability to evolve that unit into its True Form'''}}! Just get ready for a stiff challenge!

Rewards: {{Color|#0000FF|'''Li'l Cat True Forms can be unlocked'''}}

Awakened Stages include:<br>
・Li’l Cat Awakens!<br>
・Li'l Tank Cat Awakens!<br>
・Li'l Axe Cat Awakens!<br>
・Li'l Gross Cat Awakens!<br>
・Li'l Cow Cat Awakens!<br>
・Li'l Bird Cat Awakens!<br>
・Li'l Fish Cat Awakens!<br>
・Li'l Lizard Cat Awakens!<br>
・Li'l Titan Cat Awakens!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Li'l units' Awakened stages can be played after clearing Into the Future Ch. 1.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Li'l Cat's Trial available starting Day 10 of the event!'''}}<br>
Clear this tough stage to {{Color|#34A853|'''increase the Plus Level limit of your Li'l units'''}}!<br>
Rewards: {{Color|#0000FF|'''Increase the Plus Level limit of Li'l units'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Li'l Cat's Trial can be played after clearing all Li'l units' Awakened stages.

